ASAM OpenX® Standards — Redistribution Notice
================================================

This repository contains material from ASAM OpenX® standards, redistributed
under the "unrestricted distribution" clause that ASAM e.V. applies to its
publicly published simulation standards. Three kinds of material are covered:

- specification texts, converted from the published HTML to Markdown;
- normative machine-readable schemas, redistributed verbatim (XSD, JSON Schema);
- UML models of the standards, exported from ASAM's Enterprise Architect
  projects to the tool-neutral ShapeChange SCXML format.

